OL,3,GNEWSAJurors sentenced after web search
OL,4,Ahalted trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo jurors who caused a trial to
OL,7,Fcollapse after conducting their own
OL,8,Fresearch on the internet have been
OL,9,Fgiven suspended jail sentences.
OL,11,FKevin Hurford, 55, and Emma Jackson,
OL,12,F38, had been selected to be jurors in a
OL,13,Fchild sex case at Lincoln Crown Court
OL,14,Fin August last year.
OL,16,FHowever, the case had to be halted when
OL,17,Fother members of the panel sent a note
OL,18,Fraising concerns about research being
OL,19,Fcarried out by fellow jurors. The jury
OL,20,Fthen had to be discharged and the case
OL,21,Fcould not be re-tried until April this
OL,22,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
