OL,3,GNEWSAJurors sentenced after web search
OL,4,Ahalted trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoth defendants, who had no previous
OL,7,Fconvictions, admitted a charge of
OL,8,Fsharing research with other jurors.
OL,9,FThey were each sentenced to eight
OL,10,Fmonths imprisonment, suspended for two
OL,11,Fyears.
